@startuml F7.4-D04-publicar-versao
title F7.4-D04 — Publicar versão
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "PublishRequestTypeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Publicar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST /request-types/{id}/publish
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: INSERT version N+1\n+ status PUBLISHED
note right of UC
  abertas mantêm versão N
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: status PUBLISHED

@enduml
